  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3801.04 \"Nolo contendere\" means a plea by the defendant that he/she is not contesting the charges or complaint.\n\nSource. #5539, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6891, eff 11-25-98, EXPIRED: 11-25-06\n\nNew. #8823, eff 2-21-07; ss by #10825, eff 5-14-15",
